{"seq":20,"slug":"realtime-collaborative-frontend","title":"实时协作前端","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":15,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend","rating":{"composite":3.59,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introMarkdown":"# 实时协作前端\n\n实时协作前端（Real-time Collaborative Frontend）是 Google Docs 在 2006 年开创、Figma 在 2016 年大规模展示、Notion / Linear / Liveblocks 让现代 Web 应用默认期望的能力——多用户同时编辑同一份文档 / 画布 / 数据，实时看到他人的光标、选区、编辑。技术栈包括传输层（WebSocket、SSE、WebRTC）加上数据层（CRDT、OT）加上体验层（在场感知、光标、冲突解决）。CRDT（Yjs、Automerge）让并发编辑能自动合并，无需服务端协调。Liveblocks、PartyKit、Replicache 是现代的协作平台代表。本 Hub 给前端工程师一条工程化路径——基础（WebSocket / SSE / WebRTC、扩展）、协作数据（CRDT、Yjs、OT、在场感知）、协作体验（光标、选区、冲突、权限）、生产部署（服务端架构、平台选型、测试）。\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[实时协作前端] --> B[1. 实时基础]\n    A --> C[2. 协作数据]\n    A --> D[3. 协作 UX]\n    A --> E[4. 生产就绪]\n    B --> F[WebSocket / SSE / WebRTC / 扩展]\n    C --> G[CRDT / Yjs / OT / 在场感知]\n    D --> H[光标 / 选区 / 冲突 / 角色]\n    E --> I[服务端架构 / 平台 / 测试]\n```\n\n| 章节     | 核心概念                     | 实战代表             |\n| -------- | ---------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| 实时基础 | WebSocket、SSE、WebRTC、扩展 | Slack、Google Meet   |\n| 协作数据 | CRDT、Yjs、Automerge、OT     | Figma、Linear        |\n| 协作 UX  | 光标、选区、冲突、权限       | Notion、Liveblocks   |\n| 生产就绪 | 服务端架构、平台、测试       | PartyKit、Replicache |\n\n学完本 Hub 你将能选对传输方式（WS 与 SSE 与 WebRTC 之间）、用 Yjs 构建协作文档、设计多人光标加选区的体验、把协作服务端扩到百万级用户。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"realtime-foundations","title":"实时基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"websocket-and-sse","title":"WebSocket 与 SSE","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations/websocket-and-sse"},{"seq":2,"slug":"webrtc-peer-to-peer","title":"WebRTC 与点对点通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations/webrtc-peer-to-peer"},{"seq":3,"slug":"transport-selection","title":"传输协议选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations/transport-selection"},{"seq":4,"slug":"scaling-realtime","title":"实时系统扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations/scaling-realtime"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"collaborative-data","title":"协作数据","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crdt-fundamentals","title":"CRDT 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/crdt-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"yjs-and-automerge","title":"Yjs 与 Automerge","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/yjs-and-automerge"},{"seq":3,"slug":"operational-transform","title":"操作变换（OT）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/operational-transform"},{"seq":4,"slug":"awareness-and-presence","title":"Awareness 与在线感知（Presence）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/awareness-and-presence"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"collaborative-ux","title":"协作 UX","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multiplayer-cursors","title":"多人光标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/multiplayer-cursors"},{"seq":2,"slug":"selection-and-highlighting","title":"选择与高亮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/selection-and-highlighting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"conflict-feedback","title":"冲突反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/conflict-feedback"},{"seq":4,"slug":"permissions-and-roles","title":"权限与角色","url":"/l-doc-books/h